# canvas-app: soma-messages
# Boss, 0.8.10: "I'll do the tap back and then it lands and then it'll disappear and then land again."
# Isolated DEMO fixtures only, behind tools/walkthrough/messages-mac-lag-proxy.py with 15 seconds of delay, as the Direct
# service's chat.db has: INJECT_EPHEMERAL_DEMO_TOKEN, INJECT_DEMO_HOST, INJECT_DEMO_PORT. Reopening the chat fetches
# the history while the Mac's copy doesn't have the tapback yet. Fails on 0.8.10.
fold folded
wait 1200
shell cmd statusbar collapse
shell pm clear dev.omalauncher.messages
shell pm grant dev.omalauncher.messages android.permission.READ_CONTACTS
shell pm grant dev.omalauncher.messages android.permission.POST_NOTIFICATIONS
shell am start -a android.intent.action.VIEW -d "'soma-messages://link?url=http%3A%2F%2FINJECT_DEMO_HOST%3AINJECT_DEMO_PORT&token=INJECT_EPHEMERAL_DEMO_TOKEN'" dev.omalauncher.messages
wait 2500
tap Link
wait 4000
expect Ana Demo
tap Ana Demo
wait 1500
expect Perfect, see you there
# Putting one on: it lands, the stale history comes, the Mac's copy comes; it never leaves.
clearlog
doubletap Perfect, see you there
wait 800
tap Tapback like
log tapback shown
wait 800
key BACK
wait 800
tap Ana Demo
wait 2000
shot tapback-held-through-history card=messages-parity-reaction-menu
wait 16000
nolog tapback left
shot tapback-after-macs-copy card=messages-parity-reaction-menu
# Taking it off: it goes, the stale history still has it, the Mac's copy comes; it never returns.
clearlog
doubletap Perfect, see you there
wait 800
tap Tapback like
log tapback left
wait 800
key BACK
wait 800
tap Ana Demo
wait 2000
shot tapback-off-held-through-history
wait 16000
nolog tapback shown
shot tapback-off-after-macs-copy
